# System.Runtime.Intrinsics.Arm.AdvSimd+Arm64 — 64-bit-element absolute compares and
# differences, the one-lane compares (FCMEQ Sd / CMEQ Dd: an all-ones or all-zeros
# lane 0, the rest zero), 128-bit pairwise arithmetic with its D/S-register
# reductions, IEEE-754 maxNum/minNum across and pairwise, and the one-lane
# arithmetic. CMTST has no double form: the double overload tests the bits.
